---
// Gneiss is dark only, so the site is too: no light mode, and no theme
// picker (ThemeSelect.astro is empty). Starlight's pickers call
// updatePickers, which has nothing to update.
---

<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
	window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>
